# lltcgweb frontend

Also follow [`.cursor/rules/lltcgweb-overhaul.mdc`](lltcgweb-overhaul.mdc) (always apply).

## Module layout

| Module | File | Responsibility |
|--------|------|----------------|
| Styles | `client/css/shell-all.css` (+ tokens/board/hub/prompts) | Extracted shell CSS — edit here, not inline in `index.html` |
| Runtime flags | `client/js/runtime-flags.js` | `TCG_MATCH_API_PRIMARY` bootstrap (before api-client); cutover flips default here |
| API client | `client/js/api-client.js` | `apiPost`, account fetch, sync meta, **match-primary routing** |
| Game sync | `client/js/game-sync.js` | Poll loop, SSE sync, `pullLatestState`, `startPoll`/`stopPoll` |
| State apply | `client/js/state-apply.js` | `onState`, `applyStateUpdate`, pending state queue |
| Board paint | `client/js/board-render.js` | `renderGame`, stage/hand/live/log paint, `llBoardViewModel` |
| Zone WCs | `client/js/components/board-zones.js` | `<ll-stage-board>`, `<ll-hand-zone>`, `<ll-live-zone>`, `<ll-prompt-host>`, `<ll-side-panel>` |
| Replay debug | `client/js/replay-debug.js` | `?debug` replay export |
| Prompt UI | `client/js/prompt-renderer.js` | Full prompt UI: submit guards, pick openers, `handlePromptChoice`, **`renderPrompt`** |
| CPU loop | `client/js/cpu-loop.js` | CPU decision/act helpers extracted from shell |
| CPU entry | `client/js/cpu-ai.js` | `cpuResolvePrompt` entry |

Load order (see `index.html`): i18n → sfx → **client/js/** (`api-client` → `game-sync` → `state-apply` → …) → main inline script → spectacle → **`board-render.js`** → **`board-zones.js`** → cpu-meta/eval/expert → **`cpu-loop.js`** → **`cpu-ai.js`** → `bootApp()`.

## Rules

- **Do not** add large new features or CSS inline in `index.html` — use `client/js/*.js` / `client/css/*` and a thin mount if needed.
- **Do not** put `apiPost` / match networking inside `<ll-*>` components — emit `ll-card-click` / `ll-slot-pick` (or call existing shell handlers).
- Prefer feeding zones with **immutable view-models** (`llBoardViewModel` + `llApplyBoardViewModel`) after paint.
- **Do not** introduce a bundler for Hostinger deploy unless explicitly requested.
- i18n remains `i18n.js` / `log_i18n.js` / `tutorial_ja.json`. **All new player-visible copy must include Japanese, Spanish, Korean, Chinese, and Thai** — see `.cursor/rules/user-facing-copy.mdc` (i18n section).
- After hub/board shell changes: `node scripts/overhaul_smoke.mjs`.

## Deploy

Include changed `client/js/*`, `client/css/*`, and `index.html` in `LLR_SITE_FILES` when deploying via Chiichan.
